</inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A motor supporting device which is constituted by forming a cover section (10) which planarly covers a gear holding section (9) integrally with a motor housing section (8) in such a way that the cover section (10) is maintained easily in a closed state and providing a lateral pressure section (17) and a bearing section (18) to the cover section (10). Therefore, the noise from gears (6 and 13) can be reduced with a simple constitution without increasing the number of parts.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif support de moteur comprenant un couvercle (10) plat qui recouvre une partie à engrenages (9) de manière intégrée avec une partie carter de moteur (8), afin de maintenir facilement le couvercle (10) à l'état fermé et d'établir une zone de pression latérale (17) et une zone porteuse (18) pour le couvercle (10). En conséquence, le bruit des engrenages (6 et 13) est réduit par une configuration simple, sans augmentation du nombre de pièces.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>